==Finnish==

===Pronunciation===
*Hyphenation: luon·to
*{{IPA|/ˈluonto/}}

===Noun===
{{fi-noun|luon|type=1|grad=J}}
#[[nature]], [[environment]]:
#:*'''Luontoa''' [[olla#Finnish|on]] [[suojella|suojeltava]].
#:**''Nature'' must be protected.
#[[characteristic]]s of a person (the derived adjective ''-luontoinen'' is more common):
#:*[[hän|Hän]] on [[hyväluontoinen|hyvä'''luontoinen''']]. / (''very rarely said'') [[hän|Hänellä]] on [[hyvä]] '''luonto'''.
#:**She is good-''natured''. / She has a good ''nature''.
#''luonnossa'' = in [[kind]]:
#:*[[hän|Hän]] [[maksaa|maksoi]] '''luonnossa'''.
#:**He paid ''in kind''.

